          "thread": "God Mode smart contract backdoors",
          "why": "The revelation that developers routinely embed privileged override functions exposes 'immutable' as a marketing claim that can be silently false, threatening the foundational DeFi promise of trustless code."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://www.ca5.uscourts.gov/opinions/pub/23/23-50669-CV0.pdf",
          "thread": "Regulatory battles over immutable code",
          "why": "The Tornado Cash court ruling and the SEC dropping its Immutable probe together defined the legal frontier: whether governments can sanction or prosecute code that no single party controls."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://review.stanfordblockchain.xyz/p/69-type-iii-stablecoins",
          "thread": "Truly immutable financial primitives",
          "why": "Type III Stablecoins framed autonomously enforced, human-override-free systems as the next ideological frontier, attracting readers who see governance capture as the core DeFi unsolved problem."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://polygon.technology/blog/introducing-immutable-zkevm-powered-by-polygon-the-home-of-gaming-in-web3-in-partnership-with-immutable",
